# Build and Execution Instructions

## Prerequisites

The project requires:

* Python 3.9 or newer
* pip package manager
* OpenCV
* NumPy
* Matplotlib

GPU acceleration is optional. If a CUDA-enabled OpenCV build is available, the tracker automatically utilizes GPU-based template matching. Otherwise, the application falls back to CPU execution.

